## Goal
Perform principal component analysis (PCA) of the gene expression matrix to visualize the relationships between samples based on global expression patterns. The analysis will project all samples onto principal components and color them by experimental condition (untreated vs treated) to assess whether conditions cluster separately and identify the major drivers of variation.

